# Card & Delivery Validation

## Card (fake but real structure)

| Field | Rules |
|---|---|
| Number | Digits only; 13–19 length; spaces optional in UI; Luhn recommended |
| Exp | Future MM/YY; reject expired |
| CVV | 3–4 digits; never persist |
| Holder | Non-empty; reasonable charset |

- Detect Visa (`4…`) / Mastercard (`51–55`, `2221–2720`) for logo plus.
- Mask in UI after entry where possible; summary shows last-4 only.

## Delivery

- Full name, phone, email (valid format), address line, city, region/postal as required by model.
- Reject empty/whitespace; normalize phone/email before API.

## Fees on summary

`total = productPrice + baseFee + deliveryFee` — base fee always applied; show line items in backdrop before charge.
